    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/fddd46e507173b6c48befd8d6e54899b.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=800 height=171 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/fddd46e507173b6c48befd8d6e54899b.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord channel to get the latest testing plan!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get more info, don't forget to follow @SensoryPatch ;)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a peaceful and soothing environment that effortlessly helps you enter a flow state. Enjoy a selection of calming music and white noise, complemented by the gentle movements of fish and the flowing water in a beautifully landscaped aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Deep Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your focus tasks and use time management tools like the Pomodoro timer to cultivate better focus habits and stay concentrated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Colorful Aquarium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>&quot;Fish Only!&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various unique fish.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them to help them grow, and personalize their home with a variety of decorative elements for a richer focus experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed rare and one-of-a-kind fish\u2014new life always brings surprises!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game encyclopedia to discover fascinating facts about each fish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Ongoing Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your focus also nurtures your aquarium\u2014complete tasks to earn extra coins! Whether you're studying, working, or just taking a mental break, a group of adorable fish will always be there to keep you company.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/62e04c64b293c53e938b4b8016a3df29.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Flow of Self-Healing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a peaceful and soothing environment that effortlessly helps you enter a flow state. Enjoy a selection of calming music and white noise, complemented by the gentle movements of fish and the flowing water in a beautifully landscaped aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/13c0ee3f1ec43c8efaef5c339c99489a.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Deep Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your focus tasks and use time management tools like the Pomodoro timer to cultivate better focus habits and stay concentrated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/53ffcc905d62cbcbea5bf155a5df9465.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Colorful Aquarium</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>&quot;Fish Only!&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various unique fish.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them to help them grow, and personalize their home with a variety of decorative elements for a richer focus experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed rare and one-of-a-kind fish\u2014new life always brings surprises!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the in-game encyclopedia to discover fascinating facts about each fish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.poster.avif?t=1755615606\" width=700 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.webm?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395760/extras/dbb18761ddceffd1a06d5907214653a8.mp4?t=1755615606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Ongoing Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your focus also nurtures your aquarium\u2014complete tasks to earn extra coins! Whether you're studying, working, or just taking a mental break, a group of adorable fish will always be there to keep you company.</p>",
    "short_description": "With Me: Aquatic Time! is a gamified focus tool where you raise fish and design your aquarium. With soothing music, flowing water, and gently swimming fish, it creates a relaxing space to boost focus. Discover, breed, and nurture fish while personalizing your tranquil aquatic world.",
